ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4713,"interpretation":"mixed source/value refinement","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4497},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4774,"interpretation":"value facets required","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4714},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":6207,"interpretation":"exact O1 policy row","origin":"explicit","start_byte":5156}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"For every input satisfying A1, execution of the sole typed arity-1 entry solve in canonical program.vscore.json returns the JSON integer r=sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m). Each floor is the unique integer q satisfying m*q<=a*i+b<m*(q+1), including negative numerators; n=0 gives r=0. The actual source implementation must universally refine this complete formula. O1 is a mixed source/value guarantee with value_required=true whose formal contract retains file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and the exact closed source properties typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. Mathematical existence, equality alone or example agreement cannot replace these source requirements."},{"acceptance_criteria":["Exactly one admitted typed solve entry of arity 1 exists in the specified canonical artifact and profiles.","For every valid input, execution and serialization preserve structure and exact ordering and return the exact floor sum, including zero for n=0.","The formal contract retains all seven exact source properties with value_required=true.","Universal source implementation refinement proves the complete functional formula wi