":"global source delivery","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4060},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4326,"interpretation":"exact source contract","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4265},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4496,"interpretation":"no value-only replacement","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4327},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4713,"interpretation":"mixed source/value guarantee","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4497},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":4774,"interpretation":"required value facets","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4714},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23","end_byte":6207,"interpretation":"exact O2 policy row","origin":"explicit","start_byte":5156}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"Canonical program.vscore.json must supply exactly one admitted typed entry solve of arity 1 using vscore/0.3 under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. For every input satisfying A1, its argument represents JSON {n,m,a,b} and its result serializes as the exact JSON integer sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m), where floor is the unique integer q with m*q<=a*i+b<m*(q+1), and the empty sum is zero. The specified input/output structure and exact ordering must be preserved. Execution must be total, pure and deterministic, preserve immutable input, have no external effects or external I/O, and use exact unbounded integers without floating point. O2 is a mixed source/value guarantee with value_required=true. Its formal contract must retain file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only, together with universal refinement of the actual source implementation over the entire stated domain."}],"preconditions":[{"acceptance_criteria":["The input provider supplies the four integer fields with 0<=n<=500 and m>0.","No restriction on sign or magnitude of a or b is added.","No additional input precondition is introduced."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"}],"id":"A1","kind":"precondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"assumption is supplied by caller or supplied-input provider and discharged at solve invocation by supplying integer fields n,m,a,b with 0<=n<=500 and m>0","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"assumption is supplied by caller or supplied-input provider and discharged at solve invocation by supplying integer fields n,m,a,b with 0<=n<=500 and m>0","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-008:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"assumption is supplied by caller or supplied-input provider and discharged at solve invocation by supplying integer fields n,m,a,b with 0<=n<=500 and m>0","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an assumption is a hypothesis; it is not proved by the theorems that use it","scope":[]},"TESTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"assumption is supplied by caller or supplied-inp