w. S2 is source-only operational with value_required=false. Its formal contract must retain file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. Source identity, totality, determinism, input preservation, purity, effect restrictions and exact integer semantics cannot be replaced by value equality."}],"schema_version":"0.1"}